          "passage": "In her 1986 paper 'On the depletion of Antarctic ozone,' the NOAA atmospheric chemist Susan Solomon proposed that ozone loss over the South Pole was driven by heterogeneous reactions on polar stratospheric clouds. Field campaigns in the late 1980s tested her account by sampling the polar atmosphere from high-altitude aircraft, by deploying balloon-borne ozone sondes, and by ______ chlorine monoxide concentrations from ground-based stations on the Antarctic continent.",
